OL,3,AFrance's government under pressure
OL,4,Aafter weekend of widespread violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance's Prime Minister Sebastien
OL,7,FLecornu is holding a crisis cabinet
OL,8,Fmeeting on Monday to assess a weekend
OL,9,Fof violence and looting across the
OL,10,Fcountry, in what were some of the worst
OL,11,Fscenes of public disorder in modern
OL,12,FFrench history.
OL,14,FInterior Minister Laurent Nunez tried
OL,15,Fto hand in his resignation, the Elysee
OL,16,FPalace (French President Macron's HQ)
OL,17,Fannounced on Monday morning. But
OL,18,Finstead, Macron has asked him to
OL,19,Fexamine how to make France's streets
OL,20,Fsafer and to bring the perpetrators of
OL,21,Fthe weekend violence to justice.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
