OL,3,AFrance's government under pressure
OL,4,Aafter weekend of widespread violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver half a million mainly peaceful
OL,7,Fprotesters demonstrated on Saturday
OL,8,Fagainst rising living costs and
OL,9,Fdwindling access to decent public
OL,10,Fservices, including a good state
OL,11,Feducation. But the protests turned
OL,12,Fnasty after groups of black-clad,
OL,13,Fmasked activists and vandals appeared.
OL,15,FAn estimated 1,500 shops and businesses
OL,16,Fwere looted and destroyed. Riot police
OL,17,Ffired tear gas and turned water cannon
OL,18,Fon crowds. They were seen hitting
OL,19,Fpeople with batons in several places.
OL,20,FFrance's interior ministry said about
OL,21,F1,000 police officers were injured on
OL,22,FSaturday, seven of them seriously.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
